                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A Real Time Strategy game inspired by some classics like that of Red Alert and Dune and a notable Supreme Commander-esq Progression during gameplay (This get's multiplied with some notable mods available on the workshop).\n\nHonestly Surprised I can get such entertainment on a limited system on my end here (Currently on a laptop). Not only I bought this here on steam I also went a mile to buy this on the google play app store. Both are well functioned and decent in terms of gameplay, controls, and balance. No FPS drops and all due to way too many units present here and on mobile too, the game is THAT optimal.\n\nNow for my gripes here... not much but only one notable downside (Worse is that this is already fixed on mobile).\n\nADD A FPS SELECTOR!! PLEASE!!\n\nI can only play the game for only 1 hour's worth of match due to the game running at 60fps ever so constantly. Give me an option to play the game at 30fps or something. Maybe a slider would work for a more personalized performance (Like a 25-120fps option...?) Please! I can't bear it not playing the game for an hour here in the laptop.\n\nAll in all the game is cool, looking forward to see what is in store for this game.",
